DOCKERFILE STRUCTURE:
Use a multi-stage build with exactly TWO stages:

Stage 1 — Builder:
  - Use an official SDK/builder base image with a valid version tag matching the primary language and runtime version (do NOT use `.x` in Docker image tags).
  - Set WORKDIR to /app.
{% if analysis.working_dir %}
